Well, since you already mention Hmisc::rcorr, have you tried it before
posting? Because it works here ...

library(Hmisc)
x <- round(matrix(rnorm(1000), ncol=10), 3)
rcorr(x)

The p-values are two-tailed, though:

cor.test(x[,1], x[,2])

